Package: net-check
Version: 0.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, curl, bind-dig, iputils-ping
Recommends: netcat, openssl-util
Description: Network connectivity diagnostics and degradation control.
 End-to-end reachability verification across WAN interfaces,
 MITM/DPI anomaly detection, CDN geo-steering analysis,
 DNS routing alignment, ISP blocking detection, path quality comparison.
 Measurements per ITU-T Y.1540/Y.1541 methodology.
Section: net
Priority: optional
